From 1dd5ad89e4d6ddf3e0b499360892e108869bc7c8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: woahwhattheheck <293286387+woahwhattheheck@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 04:20:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): register CameraLensSelector so the main window loads

LensProfile.qml and LensCalibrate.qml instantiate CameraLensSelector, but the
new component was not registered anywhere the UI loader looks:

- src/ui/components/qmldir: compiled-QML (just deploy / release) builds
  resolve component types only through qmldir, so the main window failed
  with "CameraLensSelector is not a type".
- src/resources_qml.rs: non-deploy builds (just run) embed QML through this
  explicit qrc! list; CameraLensSelector.qml and CameraCatalog.js were
  missing, with the same failure.

Refs #742
---
 src/resources_qml.rs     | 2 ++
 src/ui/components/qmldir | 1 +
 2 files changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/resources_qml.rs b/src/resources_qml.rs
index a7fda49..9086f82 100644
--- a/src/resources_qml.rs
+++ b/src/resources_qml.rs
@@ -28,6 +28,8 @@ qrc!(pub rsrc_qml,
         "src/ui/components/AdvancedSection.qml",
         "src/ui/components/BasicText.qml",
         "src/ui/components/Button.qml",
+        "src/ui/components/CameraCatalog.js",
+        "src/ui/components/CameraLensSelector.qml",
         "src/ui/components/CheckBox.qml",
         "src/ui/components/CheckBoxWithContent.qml",
         "src/ui/components/ComboBox.qml",
diff --git a/src/ui/components/qmldir b/src/ui/components/qmldir
index c518adb..d1f799b 100644
--- a/src/ui/components/qmldir
+++ b/src/ui/components/qmldir
@@ -3,6 +3,7 @@ Action 1.0 Action.qml
 AdvancedSection 1.0 AdvancedSection.qml
 BasicText 1.0 BasicText.qml
 Button 1.0 Button.qml
+CameraLensSelector 1.0 CameraLensSelector.qml
 CheckBox 1.0 CheckBox.qml
 CheckBoxWithContent 1.0 CheckBoxWithContent.qml
 ComboBox 1.0 ComboBox.qml
-- 
2.43.0

